port sysutils/zellij
type port
reason "DragonFly cases for vendored crates: cap-primitives and system-interface oflags, aws-lc-sys entropy, notify, polling"
target @any

# dragonfly/@2026Q4, @main:
# - cap-primitives 3.4.4: rustix has no OFlags::DSYNC/RSYNC on DragonFly;
#   approximate DSYNC with SYNC and skip RSYNC as for FreeBSD (devel/uv's
#   patch for 4.0.3).
# - aws-lc-sys 0.39.0: define OPENSSL_DRAGONFLY and use getentropy() like
#   the other BSDs; otherwise urandom.c needs Linux's RNDGETENTCNT
#   (misc/py-hf-xet's patches).
# - notify 8.2.0: its kqueue and mio dependencies are keyed on a
#   "dragonflybsd" target_os that does not exist (devel/ruff's patch).
# - system-interface 0.27.2: rustix has no fadvise, fallocate or
#   OFlags::DSYNC/RSYNC here; take the NetBSD and FreeBSD fallbacks.
